  "engineering_boundaries": [
    "Illustrative Cambridge parcel and equipment routes; not a construction document.",
    "Drain-down tank capacities, expansion sizing, pipe slopes, complete drainability and restart controls remain to be engineered.",
    "Fresh-air dehumidification needs a suitably cold source and capacity sizing; the 75 F room-air loop alone does not establish a 50 F dew point.",
    "Rock properties require test bores. Seasonal heat balance, winter recharge, annual cooling savings and field sizing must be revalidated against the revised hourly load.",
    "Eight hours establishes duration, not token demand. Sustained developer rates, efficient context reuse and one overlapping daily cohort are explicitly stated planning assumptions. Quota waiting is outside active time.",
    "Llama 3.1 405B is a heavy sizing proxy, not a verified best-quality model. The 2.5x Rubin rack throughput gain is transferred from R1 and requires validation.",
    "Six campuses remain below 500 MW with 338 active pairs each. No automatic shift multiplier or additional concurrency discount is applied.",
    "The $2.64B per-site and $15.82B fleet subtotals buy compute racks only at the inherited $7.8M price. A new total project budget and payback are not established.",
    "Eight loaded hours use about 666 MWh per campus, plus idle and transition electricity. Daily and annual energy require the total operating-load schedule; remaining hours are not assumed to draw zero.",
    "Heavy-model context cache, storage bandwidth, additional support power and reliability reserves require validation.",
    "Stone-wool wall cores are enclosed between steel faces. Edge closures, joints, penetrations, fire-stopping and installation dust controls require the selected assembly specifications and final engineering.",
    "Worst-case cold-snap heat balance and minimum flow to each exposed section remain uncalculated. Aggregate computer heat does not prove freeze protection.",
    "Air-assisted drainage and complete coil emptying require equipment-specific engineering; opening drains and vents alone does not establish freeze protection.",
    "Fan animation illustrates operation; displayed speed and simultaneous rotation are not an engineered fan-control schedule."
  ],
